---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | Airdroplyx">
  <Header />
  <main class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-slate">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p>Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</p>
    
    <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p>By accessing Airdroplyx, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.</p>
    
    <h2>2. Educational Purposes Only (No Financial Advice)</h2>
    <p>The information provided on Airdroplyx is for educational and informational purposes only. We do not provide financial advice. Cryptocurrency investments and airdrop farming carry significant risk.</p>
    
    <h2>3. Accuracy of Information</h2>
    <p>While we strive to provide accurate and up-to-date information, we cannot guarantee the reliability of any third-party airdrop or project listed on our site.</p>
    
    <h2>4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>Airdroplyx shall not be liable for any losses, damages, or issues arising from your participation in any third-party airdrops or cryptocurrency investments.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
